; Permut8 host native signature manifest for GAZL signature validation.
;
; These are the native functions the Permut8 host registers for firmware code,
; described in docs/Permut8 Firmware API.md ("Native Functions"). Run the GAZL
; validator from the SDK root so it auto-loads this file:
;
;     tools/bin/NuXJS tools/gazl-validate.js <compiled>.gazl
;
; The validator cross-checks both direct and indirect native call sites against
; these signatures by name. Keep entries in host-registration order so additions
; are easy to diff.

; signature extern native abort() -> void
; signature extern native trace(ptr message) -> void
; signature extern native yield() -> void
; signature extern native write(int offset, int frameCount, ptr values) -> void
; signature extern native read(int offset, int frameCount, ptr values) -> void
